  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas Makeni response to  combating the recurrent of cholera outbreak in Sierra Leone</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to commit CAFOD to join the Government of Sierra Leone, other development partners and health service providers, in fighting against the epidemic of cholera Port Loko and Kambia districts in the country. Strategies would include mobilizing market women and residents of urban/peri urban slum areas to improve hygiene and sanitation conditions in markets and crowded streets.  Focus will be particularly on food safety among food vendors in markets, public places and schools, as contaminated food is a major source of cholera transmission.</narrative>
  </description>
